# Cloudflare static-asset headers. Rules accumulate top to bottom, so later rules detach (!) a header before resetting it.
# HTML, scripts and data revalidate on every load (assets are cache-busted with ?v=); metadata and art are public,
# cacheable for a day and CORS-open for wallets, explorers and marketplaces.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/metadata/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/img/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
